            "detailed_description": "<strong>Tower across the universe!</strong><br><br>Take on the role of Sarah, a single mother and aspiring architect who is commissioned by the enigmatic Boss to build a sprawling tower that stretches beyond terrestrial boundaries. <br>But as Sarah builds taller and taller, she draws the ire of Craig, the unassuming Canadian who sets out stop her! <br><br>The Rosebud Condominium is a new flavor of hidden object games, featuring procedurally-generated levels so that every playthrough is a unique experience, and a quick arcade pace that keeps the player engaged for hours. <br>Beat your high score, build across the galaxy, and unlock the secrets of the Boss!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Build across 48 levels through six vivid worlds.<br></li><li>Search through over 500 varied items, from the mundane to the outright bizarre. <br></li><li>Play as Sarah, an architect aspiring to stratospheric heights! <br></li><li>Beware of Craig, who places a dozen different challenges along your path.<br></li><li>Reach the end of the universe, and maybe even a floor further...</li></ul>",
